WEBVTT

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:02.765
DUMBLEDORE:
Your attention, please.

00:00:02.931 --> 00:00:05.684
This is a great day for all of us.

00:00:05.768 --> 00:00:07.770
[DRAGON ROARING]

00:00:08.979 --> 00:00:13.233
Each of the three tasks involves
very considerable danger.

00:00:13.484 --> 00:00:16.070
-Please keep your seats at all times.
VOICE: Psst.

00:00:16.236 --> 00:00:18.989
This will minimize any risks
you may be exposed to.

00:00:19.198 --> 00:00:22.701
-Harry? Is that you?
-Yeah.

00:00:22.785 --> 00:00:24.578
I'm sure we all wish our champions...

00:00:24.745 --> 00:00:27.790
-How are you feeling? Okay?
-...the greatest of luck.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.504
The key is to concentrate.
After that, you just have to--

00:00:33.754 --> 00:00:35.506
Battle a dragon.

00:00:35.798 --> 00:00:37.800
[WHIMPERS]

00:00:39.802 --> 00:00:42.221
RITA:
Young love.

00:00:42.471 --> 00:00:44.223
Oh, how...

00:00:46.767 --> 00:00:47.893
...stirring.

00:00:50.771 --> 00:00:53.816
If everything goes unfortunately today...

00:00:53.899 --> 00:00:56.777
...you two may even
make the front page.

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:59.113
You have no business here.

00:00:59.279 --> 00:01:01.281
This tent is for champions...

00:01:01.782 --> 00:01:03.409
...and friends.

00:01:06.161 --> 00:01:10.416
No matter. We've got what we wanted.

00:01:13.544 --> 00:01:16.296
Good day, champions.
Gather round, please.

00:01:16.547 --> 00:01:20.759
Now, you've waited, you've wondered,
and at last the moment has arrived.

00:01:20.843 --> 00:01:24.054
A moment only four of you
can fully appreciate.

00:01:24.263 --> 00:01:26.265
What are you doing here, Miss Granger?

00:01:26.432 --> 00:01:29.309
Oh, um, sorry, I'll just go.

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:31.019
Barty, the bag.

00:01:31.562 --> 00:01:33.772
Champions, in a circle around me.

00:01:33.856 --> 00:01:36.942
Miss Delacour, over here. Mr. Krum.

00:01:37.192 --> 00:01:41.071
And, Potter, Mr. Potter, over here.
That's right. Now...

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:43.824
...Miss Delacour, if you will.

00:01:45.826 --> 00:01:47.077
[SNARLING]

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:49.455
CROUCH:
The Welsh Green.

00:01:50.289 --> 00:01:52.332
[GROWLS]

00:01:54.042 --> 00:01:55.335
Mr. Krum.

00:01:58.338 --> 00:02:01.717
The Chinese Fireball. Ooh.

00:02:06.847 --> 00:02:09.099
The Swedish Short-Snout.

00:02:09.725 --> 00:02:11.727
-Which leaves....
-The Horntail.

00:02:11.894 --> 00:02:13.979
-What's that, boy?
-Nothing.

00:02:14.605 --> 00:02:15.898
[GRUNTS]

00:02:17.483 --> 00:02:19.902
CROUCH:
The Hungarian Horntail.

00:02:19.985 --> 00:02:21.904
[ROARING]

00:02:21.987 --> 00:02:25.115
These represent four
very real dragons...

00:02:25.365 --> 00:02:28.368
...each of which has been given
a golden egg to protect.

00:02:28.619 --> 00:02:30.996
Your objective is simple:

00:02:31.246 --> 00:02:32.831
Collect the egg.

00:02:32.915 --> 00:02:35.918
This you must do,
for each egg contains a clue...

00:02:36.001 --> 00:02:39.630
...without which you cannot hope
to proceed to the next task.

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:41.006
Any questions?

00:02:42.007 --> 00:02:44.843
Very well. Good luck, champions.

00:02:44.927 --> 00:02:47.763
Mr. Diggory, at the sound of the cannon,
you may--

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:50.015
[RITA SHRIEKING]

00:02:50.265 --> 00:02:52.518
[CROWD CHEERING]

00:02:56.396 --> 00:03:00.150
CROWD [CHANTING]:
Diggory! Diggory! Diggory!

00:03:11.912 --> 00:03:15.123
DUMBLEDORE: Three of our champions
have now faced their dragons...

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:18.877
...and so each one of them
will proceed to the next task.

00:03:18.961 --> 00:03:22.548
And now our fourth
and final contestant.

00:03:24.424 --> 00:03:27.970
CROWD [CHANTING]:
Harry! Harry! Harry!

00:03:53.203 --> 00:03:54.788
CROWD:
Oh!

00:03:54.997 --> 00:03:56.832
[DRAGON ROARING]
[CROWD SCREAMING]

00:03:57.457 --> 00:03:59.001
[SCREECHES]

00:04:03.589 --> 00:04:05.716
[PANTS AND GRUNTS]

00:04:12.097 --> 00:04:14.016
[GASPING]

00:04:17.477 --> 00:04:18.729
Aah!

00:04:21.023 --> 00:04:22.190
[ROARS]

00:04:35.078 --> 00:04:38.040
Your wand, Harry! Your wand!

00:04:38.624 --> 00:04:40.626
Accio Firebolt!

00:04:47.049 --> 00:04:48.884
[SCREECHES]

00:05:09.655 --> 00:05:11.865
-Yeah! Woo-hoo!
-Yes!

00:05:15.035 --> 00:05:16.244
Ooh.

00:05:20.749 --> 00:05:22.084
Oh, my God.

00:05:28.048 --> 00:05:30.509
[SCREAMING]

00:05:31.802 --> 00:05:35.097
-Yeah! Whoo!
-Yeah! Well done, dragon!

00:06:07.087 --> 00:06:09.923
[YELLING]

00:06:12.092 --> 00:06:13.969
[PANTING]

00:06:18.348 --> 00:06:20.559
[ROARS]

00:06:27.607 --> 00:06:29.735
[GROWLING]

00:06:32.612 --> 00:06:34.239
Aah!

00:06:38.618 --> 00:06:40.746
[GRUNTING]

00:06:43.957 --> 00:06:46.001
[ROARING]

00:07:03.977 --> 00:07:06.146
[YELLING]

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:37.886
[YELLING]

00:07:42.224 --> 00:07:44.226
[DRAGON SCREECHING]

00:07:49.439 --> 00:07:51.566
[CROWD MURMURING]

00:08:07.207 --> 00:08:09.251
Yes! Yes!

00:08:12.462 --> 00:08:14.256
[BROOM SPUTTERING]

